    <div class="xl:container px-6">
      <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-white mb-12 md:mb-16 text-center">
          Risk-free to try
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 md:gap-10">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 mx-auto">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Cancel anytime</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-home-text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto">
              No annual contracts. Cancel whenever.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 mx-auto">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">We'll make it right</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-home-text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto">
              Something broken? Email us and we'll sort it out.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 mx-auto">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"/><path d="M2 12h20"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">10-minute deploy</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-home-text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto">
              Install the CLI in under 2 minutes. Upload in seconds. Point your name and see your site live within 10.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Section 11: FAQ */}
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="xl:container px-6">
      <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-white mb-12 md:mb-16 text-center">
          Frequently asked questions
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-home-card-bg rounded-lg p-6 border border-home-text/10">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">What kinds of sites can I host?</h3>
            <p class="text-home-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Static sites only. Portfolios, documentation, dApp frontends, and any site built on a static framework. No server-side code or databases.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-home-card-bg rounded-lg p-6 border border-home-text/10">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">Can I point my ENS name at a Pinner-hosted site?</h3>
            <p class="text-home-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Yes. Upload your site with <code class="bg-home-text/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-home-text">pinner upload</code>, run <code class="bg-home-text/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-home-text">pinner point</code> to get your contenthash, and paste it into your ENS manager. Your site will be accessible at myname.eth.limo.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-home-card-bg rounded-lg p-6 border border-home-text/10">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">What about Handshake (HNS)?</h3>
            <p class="text-home-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Yes. Set a DNSLink TXT record on your HNS domain pointing to your content address. Resolve via any HNS-compatible DNS resolver.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-home-card-bg rounded-lg p-6 border border-home-text/10">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">Is my site always online?</h3>
            <p class="text-home-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              We copy your files across the Sia network to independent hosts. If one host goes offline, others keep serving your content as long as your account is active and Pinner is operational.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-home-card-bg rounded-lg p-6 border border-home-text/10">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">Can I update my site without changing my ENS record?</h3>
            <p class="text-home-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Yes. Upload your new build, then run <code class="bg-home-text/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-home-text">pinner point</code> again with the new CID. The same ENS contenthash now resolves to the updated content.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-home-card-bg rounded-lg p-6 border border-home-text/10">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">How does pricing work?</h3>
            <p class="text-home-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Pay for storage and bandwidth, priced upfront. No API call charges.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Section 12: Bottom CTA */}
  <section class="py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="xl:container px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-white mb-4 lg:mb-6">
        Deploy a site on your terms.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-home-text-muted text-base md:text-lg mb-10 max-w-md mx-auto">
        Your name. Your content. On infrastructure you control.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <TrackedButton
          label="Get started"
          url={config.registerUrl("hosting")}
          buttonStyle="btn-light"
          trackEvent="host_bottom_cta_clicked"
          client:load
        />
        <TrackedButton
          label="One-line install"
          url="https://docs.pinner.xyz/ipfs/cli/getting-started"
          buttonStyle="outline"
          trackEvent="host_cli_install_clicked"
          client:load
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
